<title>ITALY: Meridiana reports sharply lower 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Meridiana reports sharply lower 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian private sector airline, Meridiana said 1996 net profit was 870 million lire against 5.07 billion for the previous year,</p>
<p>Sales revenue for 1996 compared to 1995 was as follows</p>
<p>(in billion lire)</p>
<p>			     1996		 1995</p>
<p>Passenger traffic     449.5		478.5</p>
<p>Cargo and sundries     14.5		 15.9</p>
<p>Charter flights	  12.8		 18.3</p>
<p>Total		     476.8		512.7</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
